msgctxt "aa_ticket"
msgid "canned reply"
msgstr "respuesta predefinida"

#: models/config.py:216
msgctxt "aa_ticket"
msgid "canned replies"
msgstr "respuestas predefinidas"

#: models/config.py:224
msgctxt "aa_ticket"
msgid "auto-close after (days)"
msgstr "cierre automático tras (días)"

#: models/config.py:227
msgctxt "aa_ticket"
msgid ""
"Tickets waiting for the requester are closed automatically after this many "
"days without a reply."
msgstr ""
"Los tickets que esperan al solicitante se cierran automáticamente tras este "
"número de días sin respuesta."

#: models/config.py:230
msgctxt "aa_ticket"
msgid "warn before auto-close (hours)"
msgstr "avisar antes del cierre automático (horas)"

#: models/config.py:232
msgctxt "aa_ticket"
msgid ""
"The requester and the assignee are warned this many hours before a ticket "
"closes automatically."
msgstr ""
"El solicitante y el asignado reciben un aviso este número de horas antes de "
"que un ticket se cierre automáticamente."

#: models/config.py:235
msgctxt "aa_ticket"
msgid "requester can reopen for (days)"
msgstr "el solicitante puede reabrir durante (días)"

#: models/config.py:237
msgctxt "aa_ticket"
msgid ""
"For this many days after closing, the requester can reopen the ticket. Staff"
" can always reopen."
msgstr ""
"Durante este número de días tras el cierre, el solicitante puede reabrir el "
"ticket. El personal siempre puede reabrirlo."

#: models/config.py:240
msgctxt "aa_ticket"
msgid "open tickets per person"
msgstr "tickets abiertos por persona"

#: models/config.py:243
msgctxt "aa_ticket"
msgid ""
"A person cannot submit a new ticket while this many of their tickets are "
"still open."
msgstr ""
"Una persona no puede enviar un ticket nuevo mientras tenga abiertos este "
"número de tickets."

#: models/config.py:246
msgctxt "aa_ticket"
msgid "maximum image size (MB)"
msgstr "tamaño máximo de imagen (MB)"

#: models/config.py:249
msgctxt "aa_ticket"
msgid "delete images after (days)"
msgstr "eliminar imágenes tras (días)"

#: models/config.py:252
msgctxt "aa_ticket"
msgid ""
"Images of tickets closed longer than this are deleted. Leave empty to keep "
"them forever."
msgstr ""
"Se eliminan las imágenes de los tickets cerrados hace más tiempo que esto. "
"Déjalo vacío para conservarlas siempre."

#: models/config.py:255 models/config.py:270 templates/aa_ticket/prefs.html:13
msgctxt "aa_ticket"
msgid "Discord direct messages"
msgstr "Mensajes directos de Discord"

#: models/config.py:257
msgctxt "aa_ticket"
msgid ""
"When on and aa-discordbot is installed, people also get notifications as "
